# Executables & installers
*.exe
*.msi
*.crdownload
*.zip

# Sensitive files: environment files (the .example templates stay tracked), private keys and
# certificates, the VM's environment file (CI builds it per deploy; a local copy must never be
# committed), and the Razorpay export. Security audit 2026-11-05, F17.
.env
.env.*
*.env.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
gateway.env
deploy/aws/*.env
Assets/rzp-key.csv
Assets/password.html

# Working folders and agent state: business documents, scratch files and local tool
# configuration that must never reach the public repository (nor a release: package-release.sh
# refuses output/, tmp/ and Microsoft/; .assetsignore keeps them out of the Worker's assets).
output/
tmp/
Microsoft/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Large binaries
*.pdf
Assets/*.mp4

